{"src":"it","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":241600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"it","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":12443.786561,"text":"Se avete visto il film Il mistero dei Templari, potreste pensare che sul retro della dichiarazione di indipendenza sia disegnata una mappa del tesoro."},{"kind":"text","t":13486.941681,"text":"If you have seen the movie National Treasure, you might think that there is a treasure map drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":13604.296494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13606.023745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13607.254995000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":13608.542403000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":13610.179166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13611.774439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13612.308790000001,"samples":21192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":17688.911079,"text":"La cioccolata calda è allo stesso livello di quella belga."},{"kind":"text","t":18174.64129,"text":"The hot chocolate is on par with the Belgian one."},{"kind":"audio","t":18283.22114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":18288.385634000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18291.59909,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":23100.599086000002,"text":"I succhi di frutta sono costosi, ma molto buoni."},{"kind":"text","t":23588.431381000002,"text":"The fruit juices are expensive, but very good."},{"kind":"audio","t":23750.549395000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23755.348634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23758.443202000002,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":26946.774816,"text":"Comunque questo è falso."},{"kind":"text","t":27236.062948,"text":"Anyway, this is false."},{"kind":"audio","t":27342.834239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27345.354037,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":33684.187947,"text":"Anche se sul retro del documento c'è scritto qualcosa."},{"kind":"text","t":34304.043201,"text":"Even though there is something written on the back of the document."},{"kind":"audio","t":34412.949986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34418.108979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34423.522889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":34423.990291,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37604.21275,"text":"Non si tratta di una mappa del tesoro."},{"kind":"text","t":37929.109686,"text":"It is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":38034.729446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38037.509109,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":49668.110667,"text":"Ti potrebbero anche interessare i pareri di governi diversi dal tuo, ma tieni comunque presente che tali pareri sono mirati ai cittadini di quei governi."},{"kind":"text","t":50937.607064,"text":"You might also be interested in the opinions of governments other than your own, but keep in mind that such opinions are aimed at the citizens of those governments."},{"kind":"audio","t":51108.53336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51110.241901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51111.700027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51113.094863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51114.763695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":51116.458077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51117.988561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51118.539032,"samples":21424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":58539.600108,"text":"L'isola di Hong Kong, che dà il suo nome all'intero territorio, rappresenta per molti turisti la meta principale."},{"kind":"text","t":59384.995162,"text":"Hong Kong Island, which gives its name to the entire territory, is the main destination for many tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":59502.516063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59503.744582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59505.312186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59506.754562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59508.391325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59509.316909,"samples":26360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":70427.708191,"text":"Chiunque decida di guidare ad altitudini elevate o sui passi montani deve tenere in considerazione la possibilità di neve."},{"kind":"text","t":71264.550518,"text":"Anyone who decides to drive at high altitudes or on mountain passes must take the possibility of snow into consideration."},{"kind":"audio","t":71386.001903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71391.128107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71396.370219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71401.637781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":71407.05684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71412.302962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71415.454199,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":73717.636932,"text":"ghiaccio o di temperature vicino allo zero."},{"kind":"text","t":74032.710942,"text":"ice or temperatures near zero."},{"kind":"audio","t":74139.527192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74144.15328500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":74144.293223,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":84647.298515,"text":"Generazione dopo generazione, segregazioni e ricombinazione."},{"kind":"text","t":85019.885887,"text":"Generation after generation, segregation and recombination."},{"kind":"audio","t":85131.022968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85136.047804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85141.412295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85144.885427,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":90370.338166,"text":"ridistribuiscono la variabilità avanti e indietro."},{"kind":"text","t":90764.495939,"text":"redistribute the variability back and forth."},{"kind":"audio","t":90869.226777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90871.035597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90871.813274,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":92610.215433,"text":"tra i due pool."},{"kind":"text","t":92884.148066,"text":"between the two pools."},{"kind":"audio","t":92990.653005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92992.668731,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":100247.47862,"text":"Il termine acaro è usato formalmente dagli entomologi per questo gruppo di insetti."},{"kind":"text","t":100860.01415,"text":"The term mite is used formally by entomologists for this group of insects."},{"kind":"audio","t":100971.511405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100976.58844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100982.038469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100986.868949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":100987.181164,"samples":328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":112848.202394,"text":"Per prima cosa, la maggior parte dei cavalieri indossa stivali d'equitazione dotati di tacco e di una suola liscia e piuttosto sottile."},{"kind":"text","t":113683.476358,"text":"First of all, most riders wear riding boots equipped with a heel and a smooth, rather thin sole."},{"kind":"audio","t":113796.749103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113801.869538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113807.16647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113812.260395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113816.486055,"samples":29728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":119140.78925,"text":"La Commissione ha costituito la risposta di Martelli."},{"kind":"text","t":119593.926341,"text":"The Commission has formulated Martelli's response."},{"kind":"audio","t":119700.210103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119701.61334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119702.533494,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":124223.959926,"text":"alle diffuse proteste. Iniziate a ottobre."},{"kind":"text","t":124609.871366,"text":"to the widespread protests. Start in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":124799.177567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124805.770307,"samples":27232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"audio","t":124943.188011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124943.749271,"samples":13432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":127814.572312,"text":"che contestano il regime."},{"kind":"text","t":128112.763442,"text":"who are protesting the regime."},{"kind":"audio","t":128222.601484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128226.610678,"samples":29032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":134299.860263,"text":"Le squadre antincendio alla fine sono riuscite a domare il fuoco alle 23.35."},{"kind":"text","t":135323.362536,"text":"The fire crews finally managed to bring the fire under control at 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":135486.762927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135491.97380100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135497.188194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135502.414397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135507.090599,"samples":31528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":142098.880108,"text":"Nella giornata di oggi si è formata nell'oceano Atlantico"},{"kind":"text","t":142515.160973,"text":"Today, a storm formed in the Atlantic Ocean"},{"kind":"audio","t":142617.402802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142619.250931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142619.784532,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":148113.361791,"text":"La decima tempesta della stagione degli uragani atlantici."},{"kind":"text","t":148617.282098,"text":"The tenth storm of the Atlantic hurricane season."},{"kind":"audio","t":148800.634787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148805.841391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148808.327239,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":152375.82907,"text":"il ciclone subtropicale Jerry."},{"kind":"text","t":152631.043494,"text":"subtropical cyclone Jerry."},{"kind":"audio","t":152732.837071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152737.666561,"samples":32632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":160843.126148,"text":"Grazie alla sua invenzione hanno fatto la loro comparsa il treno."},{"kind":"text","t":161408.213327,"text":"Thanks to his invention, the train made its appearance."},{"kind":"audio","t":161596.593513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161601.541881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161606.361251,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":165967.300432,"text":"L'automobile e diversi altri mezzi di trasporto."},{"kind":"text","t":166362.232182,"text":"The automobile and several other means of transport."},{"kind":"audio","t":166471.339777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":166476.503971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166481.95274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":166482.108717,"samples":3096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":175665.725159,"text":"La sua notorietà come centro nevralgico del lusso ebbe inizio intorno al 400 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":176285.602116,"text":"Its reputation as a hub of luxury began around 400 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":176397.134491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176402.272165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":176407.767544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176413.505598,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":176413.656826,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":179977.96442,"text":"e proseguì all'incirca fino al 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":180461.84913,"text":"and continued until approximately 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":180571.27603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180576.533832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180581.802154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":180583.042724,"samples":12696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":186989.425848,"text":"La superficie della Luna è costituita da rocce e polvere e il suo strato esterno si chiama crosta."},{"kind":"text","t":187793.952364,"text":"The surface of the Moon consists of rocks and dust, and its outer layer is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":187911.046036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187916.384157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187921.447573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187926.820954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187929.410711,"samples":20728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":195853.10183200001,"text":"Secondo una stima dell'usace, 6 pollici di pioggia potrebbero rompere gli argini danneggiati in precedenza."},{"kind":"text","t":196657.804635,"text":"According to a USACE estimate, 6 inches of rain could break the previously damaged levees."},{"kind":"audio","t":196776.351312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196782.409732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":196787.646315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196792.998456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196798.679061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":196800.766066,"samples":13160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":202845.477506,"text":"Nello specifico, si sostiene che è possibile scoprire"},{"kind":"text","t":203335.645702,"text":"Specifically, it is claimed that it is possible to discover"},{"kind":"audio","t":203446.773603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203452.033226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203457.431746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":203457.75785,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":210213.883535,"text":"Se una persona sta mentendo, interpretando le microespressioni in modo corretto."},{"kind":"text","t":210731.267068,"text":"If a person is lying, by interpreting microexpressions correctly."},{"kind":"audio","t":210840.900774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":210847.245849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":210852.878125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":210856.231539,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":220538.052022,"text":"Evitate di deturpare questi luoghi imbrattando le strutture con segni o graffiti."},{"kind":"text","t":221217.833033,"text":"Avoid defacing these places by defiling the structures with signs or graffiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":221329.83232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221335.181971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221340.499612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221345.774625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":221346.723989,"samples":11728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":229656.9351,"text":"Il rugito della tigre non è potente come quello del leone, ma assomiglia più ad una frase di parole urlate e rabbiose."},{"kind":"text","t":230754.226645,"text":"The tiger's roar is not as powerful as the lion's, but it sounds more like a string of shouted, angry words."},{"kind":"audio","t":231008.984297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231014.336538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231019.371914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231024.874233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231030.291343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231033.107216,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":241092.702464,"text":"Nel XX secolo la ricerca ha dimostrato l'esistenza di due pool di variabilità genetica, ovvero variabilità nascosta e variabilità espressa."},{"kind":"text","t":242105.22497,"text":"In the 20th century, research demonstrated the existence of two pools of genetic variability, namely hidden variability and expressed variability."},{"kind":"audio","t":242231.495299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242236.522816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":242241.900226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242247.345016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242252.48727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":242257.655114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242262.965536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242266.756023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":242266.90833,"samples":5456,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":252305.95595,"code":1005}]}